{
    "title": "Glambu - Luxury dating",
    "description": "Meet successful people online! Glambu is a private community of successful, attractive, and ambitious people who deserve a life of luxury and pleasure. \r\n\r\nEveryone has their own version of love and we believe that YOU deserve better. Join Glambu! Profiles are verified in real time to help keep the community SAFE and FUN. \r\n\r\nHow does Glambu work for women? \r\n1. Register a profile in less than two minutes. \r\n2. Get your first invitation within 24 hours. \r\n3. Choose your lucky man and continue chatting on WhatsApp or Telegram. \r\n\r\nHow does Glambu work for men? \r\n1. Register a profile in less than two minutes. \r\n2. Send an invitation to the women you like. \r\n3. Get direct access to WhatsApp or Telegram as soon as they accept. \r\n\r\nSAFETY\r\nWe value your time. Rich millionaires are busy. We review all profiles before showing them to our upscale community. Glambu executes the most accurate and reliable verification process to ensure a quality dating experience for its members. To verify your profile you have to submit a selfie with a specific gesture. Hookup content or sugar daddy related terms are forbidden but you can state if you are looking for an affair, casual dating or serious relationship.\r\n\r\nPRIVACY \r\nWomen cannot see the profile of men without first being invited by them. We prioritize privacy to allow influential and public users to join our secret community. While on other dating apps hundreds of users from the same city see your profile every day, Glambu provides privacy. As a male user, you have 100 % privacy at Glambu. Again: only a woman you invite can see your profile for a limited amount of time.\r\n\r\nMEMBERSHIP FEES \r\nGlambu is 100 % free for women. Men have to pay a membership fee. Please note that Glambu does NOT cater for sugar daddy / sugar baby relationships, but a certain age gap is accepted. Any form of compensated dating or companionship is forbidden. If you choose to purchase a premium membership, the payment will be charged to your GooglePlay account. Your account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period. \r\n\r\nYOUR PRIVACY AND SAFETY MATTER! \r\nGlambu is secure and safe. Your privacy is always the most important thing to us. To view our Privacy Policy and Terms, please visit the following links: \r\nhttps://glambu.com/terms-conditions/ \r\nhttps://glambu.com/privacy/",
